      "index": 0,
      "text": "# Railway Equipment Fleet",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Intermodal Transport Units (ITUs)",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "At SDG Railway, we operate with a modern and versatile range of Intermodal Transport Units (ITUs) — standardized equipment designed to carry cargo seamlessly across rail, road, and maritime networks without direct handling of the goods.\n\nThese units ensure operational flexibility, faster transfers, and full compatibility with European intermodal terminals and rolling stock such as the T3000e double pocket wagons.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "",
