    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "EURODUAL\n\nBI-MODE LOCOMOTIVE",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "A vehicle at the avant-garde of technology that covers every need in an efficient and reliable way, offering rail operators numerous economic and ecological benefits.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Vehicle data\n\nLocomotive type: Bi-mode (Electric/Diesel-electric).\n\nTrack gauge: 1,435 mm / 1,668 mm\n\nAxle arrangement: Co’Co’\n\nSupply voltage: 1.5 kV DC / 3 kV DC /\n\nElectric power: 15 kV AC / 25 kV AC\n\nDiesel power: Up to 7,000 kW\n\nStarting tractive effort: Up to 2,800 kW\n\nFuel tank: Up to 500 kN\n\nTransmission: Up to 4,000 l\n\nMaximum speed: AC/AC\n\nBrake system:\n\nUp to 160 km/h\n\nMechanic: Pneumatic\n\nDynamic: Regenerative/rheostatic\n\n2 distributors, one per bogie\n\nSuspension:\n\nPrimary: Coil springs\n\nSecondary: Rubber metal\n\nVertical and horizontal dampers\n\nTechnical features\n\nThe EURODUAL is more than just a «last mile» locomotive. It offers two solutions in one. The versatile locomotive can be used on freight and passenger main lines, at speeds of up to 160 km/h, and on electrified and non-electrified lines. The EURODUAL is a six-axle locomotive with AC/AC transmission and low axle-load based on service-proven components and subsystems. It has been designed with a high degree of redundancy, which increases availability. Available in different gauges and overhead\n\nvoltages (1.5 kV DC, 3 kV DC, 15 kV AC, 25 kV AC).\n\nClick below to explore our locomotive models",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": [
        {
          "t": "Click below to explore our locomotive models",
          "h": "/escolaeuropea.eu/sdgrailway/services/railway-equipment-fleet/our-locomotive-models"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "DOUBLE POCKET CAR T3000e",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "GENERAL\n\nTare weigh 34.3 tons\n\nWheelset load 22.5 tons\n\nUNDERCARRIAGE\n\nLength between buffers 34.20 m\n\nBuffer UIC 526-3, Group L\n\nBogie Y25Ls(s)i / Y25Ls(s)i1(f)\n\nWheelsets BA 004 Brake 2 x DK-GP-A-(K)\n\nWagon is suitable for transportation of:\n\n1. / all saddle semi-trailers according to UIC 596-5, Annex 3 (max. 40 t/semi-trailer),\n\n2. / ISO containers with height 8' and 8'6\" classified in UIC 592-2,\n\n3. / swap bodies C 715, C 745, and C 782 (max. 34 t + 16 t/wagon segment),\n\n4. / swap bodies of class A (max. 36 t/swap body).\n\nContainer loading combinations of the wagon are in the drawing No. N-211-00-00-30-0\n\nWagon underframe can absorb impacts against other wagons with a total weight of 80t without exceeding the maximum allowed tensions as follows:\n\nA/ empty wagon up to 12 km/h according to UIC regulation/ maximally loaded wagon up to 7 km/h\n\nLOADING PLAN\n\nLoading Semi-trailers, large and interchangeable containers of various lengths (20′ to 45′)",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
